# =============================================================================
# Turnos App — Root Environment Variables Guide
# =============================================================================
# Each app has its own .env file:
#
#   apps/api/.env          ← NestJS API (copy from apps/api/.env.example)
#
# HOW TO SET UP:
#   cp apps/api/.env.example apps/api/.env
#   # Edit apps/api/.env with your local values
#
# ENVIRONMENTS:
#   development  → apps/api/.env                (local machine)
#   staging      → set in Railway/Fly.io dashboard
#   production   → set in Railway/Fly.io dashboard (never commit!)
#
# NEVER commit any .env file to git.
# Only commit .env.example files (with placeholder values).
# =============================================================================
